+//!
+//! # no_std support
+//!
+//! This crate is `no_std` and only requires a global allocator. The default
+//! `std` feature enables integration with `std::io`; disable it to build for
+//! targets without `std`:
+//!
+//! ```toml
+//! [dependencies]
